Hit the same problem recently after upgrading to Kafka Clients 4.3.1. As suggested in the [GitHub Pull Request #21518|https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/21518], setting:
{code:java}
sasl.oauthbearer.jwt.validator.class=org.apache.kafka.common.security.oauthbearer.ClientJwtValidator{code}
worked
